<main><section class="page-space"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">THE FUTURE OF TRADING</div><h1 class="section-title">Why Trade Indices with Bytrox?</h1><p class="section-lead">Indices track the performance of a group of leading stocks, offering a simple and efficient way to gain exposure to entire markets.</p><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature"><div class="icon-circle"><img src="${ctx}/images/indices-bars.svg" alt=""></div><h3>40+ Global Indices</h3><p>Trade major indices from the US, Europe, Asia, and other global markets.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon-circle"><img src="${ctx}/images/indices-dollar.svg" alt=""></div><h3>Tight Spreads</h3><p>Enjoy spreads as low as 0.4 points on key indices with no hidden costs.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon-circle"><img src="${ctx}/images/indices-trend.svg" alt=""></div><h3>Market Diversification</h3><p>Invest in broad market movements without managing individual stocks.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon-circle"><img src="${ctx}/images/indices-bolt.svg" alt=""></div><h3>Extended Trading Hours</h3><p>Access indices across global sessions and capture more trading opportunities.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section section-soft"><div class="narrow"><h2 class="section-title">Major Indices Categories</h2><p class="section-lead">Trade the world&#10003; ?leading markets with professional execution and competitive conditions.</p><div class="category-grid "><article class="category-card"><div class="icon-circle" style="background:#4785f0"><img src="${ctx}/images/indices-flag.svg" alt=""></div><h3>US Indices</h3><p>Access top U.S. benchmarks including the S&P 500, NASDAQ.</p><small>&#10003; S&P 500 (US500)<br>&#10003; NASDAQ (US100)<br>&#10003; Dow Jones (US30)</small></article><article class="category-card"><div class="icon-circle" style="background:#21c99a"><img src="${ctx}/images/indices-pie.svg" alt=""></div><h3>European Indices</h3><p>Trade Europe&#10003; ?key indices such as the FTSE 100, DAX 40, and CAC 40.</p><small>&#10003; FTSE 100 (UK100)<br>&#10003; DAX (GER40)<br>&#10003; CAC 40 (FRA40)</small></article><article class="category-card"><div class="icon-circle" style="background:#a94df0"><img src="${ctx}/images/indices-sun.svg" alt=""></div><h3>Asian Indices</h3><p>Gain exposure to Asia&#10003; ?dynamic markets with indices like JP225, HK50.</p><small>&#10003; Nikkei 225 (JPN225)<br>&#10003; Hang Seng (HK50)<br>&#10003; ASX 200 (AUS200)</small></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="narrow"><h2 class="section-title">Tight Indices Spreads</h2><p class="section-lead">Trade leading global indices with ultra-competitive spreads designed for maximum trading efficiency.</p><div style="overflow-x:auto"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Index</th><th>Symbol</th><th>Typical Spread</th><th>Max Leverage</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="">S&P 500</td><td class="">US500</td><td class="highlight">0.4 pts</td><td class="">1:200</td></tr><tr><td class="">NASDAQ</td><td class="">US100</td><td class="highlight">1.0 pts</td><td class="">1:200</td></tr><tr><td class="">DAX</td><td class="">GER40</td><td class="highlight">1.0 pts</td><td class="">1:200</td></tr><tr><td class="">FTSE 100</td><td class="">UK100</td><td class="highlight">1.5 pts</td><td class="">1:200</td></tr><tr><td class="">Nikkei 225</td><td class="">JPN225</td><td class="highlight">6.0 pts</td><td class="">1:200</td></tr></tbody></table></div><aside class="notice-box"><b>Important Notice:</b> The spreads and leverage ratios shown above are typical/indicative values for illustration purposes only. Actual spreads may vary based on market conditions, volatility, liquidity, and time of day. Spreads may widen significantly during major news events, market openings, or periods of low liquidity. Trading conditions are subject to change without notice.</aside><div class="center"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="${ctx}/${siteLang}/account-types">View All Account Types</a></div></div></section><section class="cta"><div class="container"><h2>Ready to Start Trading Indices?</h2><p>Access global stock markets with competitive spreads and professional trading tools on our MT5 platform.</p><a class="btn btn-light" href="${ctx}/${siteLang}/account-types">Open Live Account</a><a class="btn" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:#fff" href="#">Try free demo</a></div></section></main>
